{
    "Dialogue": [
        {
            "text": "Ruben, how are you holding up?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 2,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "I... I really thought I was a goner.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 7,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "It's alright, Ruben. We're here with you now.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 1,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "I... I just want to go home. To hell with Occidens and the war.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 7,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "I'm sorry, but we can't...",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 2,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "Why? Who cares about the war. It's not our problem.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 7,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "It's gone.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 2
        },
        {
            "text": "What?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 7,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "There is no Landfall Village anymore, Ruben! It's gone, all of it. And I... I watched it burn. Grandpa, the others, they're all dead! Dead!",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "What happened? Was it the pluvials? Weren't you Hunters supposed to stay to protect it?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 7,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "Shut up. You don't know anything.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "Who even are you? What do you know about our village?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 7,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "I lived there once. You probably don't remember. Trust me, I'm as devastated as you all are. But we have to keep going.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "We'll find the ones who did this and made them pay tenfold. Now, you can stay here and cry all you want, or you can move forward with us.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "Stop it, Zack. Cut him some slack, will you? Ruben, it's fine you don't have to fight with us. You're still weak. Just take some time to gather your strength.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 2,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "I... Thank you, Elwyn, I will do that.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 7,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        }
    ]
}